0010** MMP9300 - LEADING SEQUENCE-PREFIX REGRESSION FIXTURE (ISSUE #26)
0020** Every line here begins with a 4-digit sequence number with no
0030** trailing-column analogue -- detect_leading_seq_prefix must find and
0040** strip it before dialect content matching runs. Line 0070 has no
0050** separator before the statement (like "0010DEFINE" in the issue);
0060** line 0080 has a space-padded separator (like "0080  2 #LEAVE").
0070DEFINE DATA LOCAL
0080  1 #COUNT (N4)
0090  1 #STATUS (A1) INIT <'A'>
0100END-DEFINE
0110*
0120IF #STATUS = 'A'
0130  ADD 1 TO #COUNT
0140END-IF
0150END
